            LIGO Lab — <a href="https://www.ligo.caltech.edu/page/what-are-gw" style="color:var(--blue);text-decoration:none;" target="_blank" rel="noopener">"What are Gravitational Waves?"</a>
          </li>
          <li>
            Pappas et al., "High-Frequency Gravitational Wave Search with ABRACADABRA-10 cm" — <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/2505.02821" style="color:var(--blue);text-decoration:none;" target="_blank" rel="noopener">arXiv:2505.02821</a>
          </li>
        </ol>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</Layout>
